OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, dies after being stabbed
OL,4,Ain the neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed in the neck, an inquest has
OL,8,Fheard.
OL,10,FKhadeem Parris, 16, from Motherwell,
OL,11,FNorth Lanarkshire, died on Adnitt Road,
OL,12,FNorthampton on the evening of Tuesday,
OL,13,F7 July.
OL,15,FAt Northampton Coroner's Court, senior
OL,16,Fcoroner Anne Pember said the
OL,17,Fprovisional cause of death was a "stab
OL,18,Fwound to the neck pending further
OL,19,Finvestigation".
